  "evidence": "TEXT_C: Supports full EU membership and open borders with England; grants full citizenship/residence rights to all current residents; creates a written constitution and expansive Bill of Rights with social rights; lowers voting age to 16 and uses PR; prioritises alternatives to prison and rehabilitation; phases out nuclear power, invests in renewables; withdraws from NATO and removes Trident. TEXT_F: Emphasises national sovereignty in Europe (retain veto, border controls), opposes EU federalism and Social Chapter; upholds the Union and opposes devolution; robust law-and-order measures (more police/CCTV, curfews, mandatory minimum sentences, end early release, ID card); reinforces traditional education structures (discipline, RE, selective admissions, support for grammar schools); opposes a new Bill of Rights and PR; NATO central and strong defence; stresses traditional family support via tax policy.",
